# Input

```astro
---
const x = 5;
---
<div>{/* a note */}</div>
<div class={/* a note */}>{x}</div>
<div>{// a line note
}</div>
<p>{x /* trailing */}</p>

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
const x = 5;
---

<div>{/* a note */}</div>
<div class={/* a note */}>{x}</div>
<div>
	{// a line note
	}
</div>
<p>{x /* trailing */}</p>

```
